OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhen Judy King's mother was dying,
OL,7,     FJudy promised her that she'd fight
OL,8,     Fto get back a suitcase that
OL,9,     Fbelonged to her - filled with
OL,10,     Fartworks drawn by a man her mother
OL,11,     Fhad once loved.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1981 Australia launched a fight
OL,14,     Fagainst skin cancer with help from
OL,15,     FSid the Seagull and a catchy
OL,16,     Fjingle. The Slip Slop Slap message
OL,17,     Fspread, changing attitudes to sun
OL,18,     Fprotection.
